      "kind": "nav",
      "refersTo": "watch-selected",
      "description": "固定深蓝导航中的选择行，手机转为横向列表。",
      "html": "<nav class=\"ds-nav\" aria-label=\"自选股票\"><button class=\"ds-watch\" aria-current=\"true\"><span><strong>隆基绿能</strong><small>601012</small></span><span><b>11.76</b><small>+2.26%</small></span></button></nav>",
      "css": ".ds-nav{background:var(--nav,#182b50);padding:12px;border-radius:0;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", sans-serif;line-height:1.55;}.ds-watch{font:inherit;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:5px;padding:14px 24px 14px 12px;width:100%;border:0;border-radius:8px;background:transparent;color:#eef3fc;text-align:left;cursor:pointer;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}.ds-watch:hover{background:#243b63}.ds-watch[aria-current=true]{background:#304970}.ds-watch>span{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:2px}.ds-watch>span:last-child{color:#ff8d95;text-align:right;font-size:13px}.ds-watch strong{font-size:14px;font-weight:600}.ds-watch small{font-size:11px}.ds-watch>span:first-child small{color:#bbcae0}.ds-watch:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--focus,#6489e3);outline-offset:3px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "判断标签",
      "kind": "chip",
      "refersTo": "outlook-observe",
      "description": "研究逻辑状态与行情方向分开编码；标签自身无交互。",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-outlooks\"><span class=\"ds-outlook\">观察</span><span class=\"ds-outlook ds-stronger\">逻辑增强</span><span class=\"ds-outlook ds-weaker\">逻辑减弱</span></div>",
      "css": ".ds-outlooks{display:flex;gap:12px;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", sans-serif;line-height:1.55;}.ds-outlook{background:#e3e9f4;color:#4d5c73;padding:3px 7px;border-radius:4px;font-size:10px}.ds-stronger{background:#e9e4f6;color:#674598}.ds-weaker{background:#f2e5d4;color:#7f551c}"
    },
    {
      "name": "研究面板",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "panel",
      "description": "正文容器使用平面白底及细边框。",
      "html": "<section class=\"ds-panel\"><div class=\"ds-panel-heading\"><h2>个股资金结构</h2><span>净流入 · 元</span></div><div class=\"ds-panel-body\">数字与标签在同一阅读网格中对齐。</div></section>",
      "css": ".ds-panel{font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", sans-serif;line-height:1.55;background:#fff;color:var(--ink,#1d293d);border:1px solid var(--border,#e0e5ed);border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden}.ds-panel-heading{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;padding:20px 22px 15px}.ds-panel-heading h2{margin:0;font-size:16px;font-weight:650;line-height:1.4}.ds-panel-heading span{font-size:11px;color:var(--muted,#637086)}.ds-panel-body{padding:2px 22px 22px;font-size:12px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "研究标签页",
      "kind": "nav",
      "description": "下划线标记所处研究视角。",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-tabs\" role=\"tablist\" aria-label=\"个股研究\"><button role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"true\">行情与资金</button><button role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"false\">基本面</button><button role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"false\">研究记录</button></div>",
      "css": ".ds-tabs{display:flex;gap:26px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8e6;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", sans-serif;line-height:1.55;}.ds-tabs button{font:inherit;border:0;background:none;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;padding:12px 2px 13px;color:var(--muted,#637086);position:relative;font-size:13px;font-weight:550;cursor:pointer}.ds-tabs button[aria-selected=true]{color:var(--accent,#385ac0)}.ds-tabs button[aria-selected=true]:after{content:\"\";position:absolute;bottom:-1px;left:0;right:0;height:2px;background:var(--accent,#385ac0)}.ds-tabs button:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--focus,#6489e3);outline-offset:3px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "数据快照",
      "kind": "custom",
      "description": "研究记录附带可展开的当时证据。",
      "html": "<details class=\"ds-snapshot\"><summary>当时的数据快照</summary><dl><div><dt>股价 / 涨跌幅</dt><dd>11.76 / +2.26%</dd></div><div><dt>财报截至</dt><dd>2026-09-30</dd></div></dl></details>",
      "css": ".ds-snapshot{font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", sans-serif;line-height:1.55;font-size:11px;color:var(--muted,#637086);border:1px solid #d7deea;border-radius:6px;padding:10px 12px;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}.ds-snapshot summary{cursor:pointer}.ds-snapshot summary:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--focus,#6489e3);outline-offset:3px}.ds-snapshot dl{margin:13px 0 0}.ds-snapshot dl>div{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:10px;margin-top:6px}.ds-snapshot dd{margin:0;color:var(--ink,#1d293d)}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "投资委员会审阅材料",
    "overview": "以投资委员会审阅材料为视觉参照：蓝墨色导航提供稳定定位，白色正文承载图表、财报与笔记，淡蓝紫色只标出研究入口和判断状态。数字列齐整，边界轻，信息密度适合长期查阅。\n\n中文功能文字使用系统无衬线字体，价格与正文通过字号和字重分层；它是研究工作界面，没有独立的展示字体或装饰性图片。A 股红涨绿跌是数据语义，蓝色是操作与选择语义。所有已实现画面由代码、文字和 SVG 构成。",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "蓝墨色固定导航与浅色阅读区域。",
      "表格右对齐数字，全文使用等宽数字特性。",
      "白色平面容器、细分隔线和克制的圆角。",
      "来源、数据时点与旧数据反馈保留在相应内容附近。",
      "桌面分栏，手机顺序阅读；研究记录与当时快照相邻。"
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "name": "The Semantic Color Rule",
        "body": "蓝色用于操作、选择和价格曲线；红绿表达数值方向。研究逻辑增强与减弱使用紫色、棕色标签，避免与当日涨跌混淆。",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Aligned Evidence Rule",
        "body": "数值使用 tabular-nums；表格名称列左对齐、数值列右对齐，空值保留破折号。",
        "section": "typography"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Flat Reading Surface Rule",
        "body": "正文容器以底色和细边框建立层级；仅选中的区间按钮与浮动状态通知使用阴影。",
        "section": "elevation"
      }
    ],
    "dos": [
      "**Do** 用蓝色表示可操作项与当前选择，沿用红涨绿跌及带符号的数值。",
      "**Do** 把来源与时间作为证据展示；手机保留来源链接，并将资金表的时间放在层级名称下。",
      "**Do** 沿用白色面板、细分隔线、数字列对齐及现有圆角层级。",
      "**Do** 为表单保留可见标签、清晰占位文字、错误重试入口和键盘焦点。",
      "**Do** 让研究正文自然换行；财报宽表在自身区域横向滚动。"
    ],
    "donts": [
      "**Don't** 用红绿表达研究观点增强或减弱，也不要把数据源的资金分类当作机构持仓。",
      "**Don't** 为普通正文面板添加悬浮阴影、装饰背景图或多余的副标题。",
      "**Don't** 在手机隐藏数据来源或时点以节省空间。",
      "**Don't** 将占位文字调得比 muted 更浅，或用占位文字替代字段标签。",
      "**Don't** 将当前少数紧凑辅助文字的 9–10px 尺寸推广为新界面的默认阅读字号。"
    ]
  }
}
